# =====================
# Coverage (test-coverage reports only — NOT the Java 'coverage' domain package)
# =====================

/frontend/coverage/
.coverage
# Never ignore the backend 'coverage' (RAG) Java package — a bare `coverage/` rule
# silently excludes it and breaks the Docker/Render build (missing CoverageService, etc.).
!backend/src/main/java/**/coverage/

